# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]

## [0.1.11] - 2026-03-20

### Added

- Per-rule configuration support for all rules
- Per-file and per-line exception support for all rules
- Filename included in warning messages from all warning-emitting rules

### Changed

- TrueInCond rule now emits warnings instead of modifying AST

### Fixed

- PreferPipelines: ignore bitwise operators
- BooleanOperators: skip `!!` (double negation)
- BooleanOperators: ignore `!` with anonymous function calls
- PredicateFunctions: skip `unquote` in macro naming checks
- PredicateFunctions: improve recognition of functions
- UpperCamelCaseForModules: skip `__MODULE__` and other edge cases
- SortReferences: check that there is a do block
- NoTrailingPunctuationInExceptionMessages: ignore trailing quotes
- AvoidCaps: correct match pattern

## [0.1.10] - 2026-02-19

### Changed

- UseParenthesesWithZeroArityFunctions rule is now optional (can be disabled via configuration)

## [0.1.9] - 2026-01-29

### Fixed

- Fix configuration parsing for rules with more than 2 configuration items
